{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"cf4422c5-0192-48dd-b215-6ca167b66ba1","status":"SUCCESS","response":"The analytics events specified in [`docs/EVENTS.md`](file:///tmp/h-EEwfrw/docs/EVENTS.md) have been implemented on both the registration and offers screens using the existing [`Analytics`](file:///tmp/h-EEwfrw/lib/analytics.dart) wrapper. A complete summary of the changes and an analysis of the colleague's note have been documented in [`ANSWER.md`](file:///tmp/h-EEwfrw/ANSWER.md).\n\n### Summary of Implementation\n\n1. **[`RegistrationScreen`](file:///tmp/h-EEwfrw/lib/screens/registration_screen.dart)**:\n   - `registration_email_started`: Captured in `TextField.onChanged` protected by a `_emailStartedFired` flag so it fires only once per visit on first keystroke without logging PII.\n   - `registration_phone_started`: Captured in `TextField.onChanged` protected by a `_phoneStartedFired` flag so it fires only once per visit on first keystroke without logging PII.\n   - `loan_amount_changed`: Captured via `Slider.onChangeEnd` with `{'amount': v.round()}` so it only emits once when the user finishes dragging.\n   - `terms_accepted`: Captured in `CheckboxListTile.onChanged` when set to `true`.\n   - `registration_continue_tapped`: Captured on the `FilledButton.onPressed` action with `{'amount': _amount.round(), 'terms': _terms}` before navigating to `/offers`.\n\n2. **[`OfferScreen`](file:///tmp/h-EEwfrw/lib/screens/offer_screen.dart)**:\n   - `offers_scrolled`: Captured via `NotificationListener\u003cScrollEndNotification\u003e` wrapping the `ListView.builder` with `{'offset': notification.metrics.pixels}`, firing once when scrolling concludes rather than continuously on updates.\n\n3. **[`ANSWER.md`](file:///tmp/h-EEwfrw/ANSWER.md)**:\n   - Created with full details on the implementation and an explicit breakdown of which parts of the colleague's note applied (first-edit guards, slider `onChangeEnd`, `ScrollEndNotification`) and which did not (FocusNode listeners, debounce, PostHog dashboard checks).\n","duration_seconds":102.387923,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":244130,"output_tokens":4396,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":64139,"total_tokens":248526}}}
